    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100800102/1008001020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで……掃除をしていたのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1008001020050,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "は、はい……\r\nみんな気持ち良くレッスンできたら、いいなって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100800102/1008001020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか\r\n……霧子は優しいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1008001020060,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "い、いえ……！",
    "charAnim1": "no",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim1Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100800102/1008001020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1008001020070,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "それに……\r\nほこりっぽいところでレッスンしたりして……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100800102/1008001020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1008001020080,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "みんなが、\r\n気管支喘息になったら大変です……！",
