    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100800102/1008001020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか……なるほどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……ん？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（霧子、ケガのところを押さえてるけど……痛むのかな）",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……とりあえず、霧子の気持ちはわかった\r\nなんとなくだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1008001020130,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "は、はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100800102/1008001020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、だから掃除をしようって考えるのは、\r\nすごく偉いことじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1008001020140,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100800102/1008001020140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もしかして、普段もこっそり掃除とかしてるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1008001020150,
    "speaker": "霧子",
